1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,380
Wind is different.

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:04,934
It does not change the speed of sound relative to the air.

3
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:07,135
It carries the air itself along.

4
00:00:07,135 --> 00:00:16,015
If a wind of speed w blows at an angle theta to the sound, the speed over the ground is v plus w cos theta.

5
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:18,320
Downwind, the sound gets a push.

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,299
Upwind, it is held back.

7
00:00:20,299 --> 00:00:23,138
That is why sound carries further downwind.

